// The item classes every strain uses (CannabisPlus 4). Each item carries its strain as a record (scripts:
// CP_GeneticItem.c), which gives it its name and its look. Generated by gen_genetics_config.ps1.
//
// Looks: each class in CfgCannabisStrainLooks holds one strain's textures. A strain uses the look named like it
// (or the "Look" in its json). An item class says in cpLookTextures[] / cpLookMaterials[] which look entry goes on
// each of its hidden selections; entries a look doesn't have keep the class's plain texture below.
// Look entries: plant, plantMat, bud, bag, seedsPack, seedsPackMat, jointPack.
// To add a strain's textures in another mod: add a class to CfgCannabisStrainLooks (requiredAddons CP_Genetics).
